#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:5 55f0ed6bdd884ff9971f9c36178f7cda
msgid "SkyRocket SkyViper (Developer Information)"
msgstr "SkyRocket SkyViper（开发者信息）"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:7 2b9dfd7a07194d59adbc6402f88e2e5e
msgid ""
"This page provides information for developers working with the SkyRocket "
"SkyViper Ready-to-fly copter."
msgstr "本页面为使用 SkyRocket SkyViper 即飞型多旋翼飞行器的开发者提供相关信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:14 841ee860c9124eecbad460be53e34570
msgid ""
"Please do not attempt to claim under warranty if you make your device "
"unbootable by flashing your own firmware."
msgstr "如果您刷入自己的固件导致设备无法启动，请不要尝试申请保修。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:18 e851abd9a90b47208118c2dec26f0c31
msgid ""
"These instructions relate to the current SkyViper2450GPS unit.  Previous "
"iterations of this product - with the same name - did not incorporate "
"ArduPilot.  In-store, the ArduPilot SkyViper2450GPS unit can be identified "
"by the ArduPilot logo prominently displayed on the back of the box."
msgstr ""
"本说明适用于当前的 SkyViper2450GPS 型号。同名产品的早期版本未搭载 ArduPilot。在实体店中，搭载 ArduPilot 的 "
"SkyViper2450GPS 可通过包装盒背面显著展示的 ArduPilot 标志加以辨别。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:22 f3650c74e36842ec8806b95135c6e1f0
msgid ""
"These instructions relate specifically to developing and updating the Open "
"Source code present on the drone.  For general help and information on the "
"SkyViper, please visit SkyRocket's website: http://sky-viper.com/"
msgstr ""
"本说明专门针对开发和更新无人机上的开源代码。有关 SkyViper 的一般帮助和信息，请访问 SkyRocket 官网：http://sky-"
"viper.com/"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:26 fabc0d89a16c4339858c57b9fa1c4683
msgid ""
"Update the firmware to the latest version before attempting to use your own "
"code; there have been updates to the recovery firmware which make the system"
" more resilient to faulting when upgrading."
msgstr "在尝试使用自己的代码之前，请先将固件更新至最新版本；恢复固件已有更新，可使系统在升级时更能抵御故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:29 a5185ad4f3bc401999cb3fe9b4d5e499
