#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:77 af9609b423a249b8b79872b0402cc08c
msgid "Flight Controller Recovery using the SD card"
msgstr "通过 SD 卡恢复飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:79 681de46edd7c450ca643c7382fe33b37
msgid ""
"If the Flight Controller becomes un-flashable at runtime, recovery is "
"possible using the SD card at boot time."
msgstr "如果飞控在运行时无法刷写，可在启动时通过 SD 卡进行恢复。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:81 09da08d937cd46f389080a4718fe7283
msgid ""
"Place a copy of ``arducopter.abin`` in the root directory of the SD card - "
"but change its name to ``flight_fw.abin``"
msgstr "将 ``arducopter.abin`` 的副本放在 SD 卡根目录下，但将其改名为 ``flight_fw.abin``。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:83 1f6f831dd58143bd99044a23ed1e3a98
msgid ""
"Rebooting will cause the Sonix board to flash the Flight Controller before "
"the STM32 leaves the bootloader."
msgstr "重启后，Sonix 板将在 STM32 离开引导程序之前刷写飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:87 d9046c641fb64c3b97fe0667c9edb553
msgid "Sonix board Recovery using the SD card"
msgstr "通过 SD 卡恢复 Sonix 板"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:89 6311688beb1142f9a8aba69f601ce2a9
msgid ""
"In the rare event you may need to recover Sonix board using the SD card at "
"the boot time."
msgstr "在极少数情况下，您可能需要在启动时通过 SD 卡恢复 Sonix 板。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:91 16e7c2e4916145deade8254a9092e047
msgid ""
"Place a copy of FIRMWARE_660R_F.bin in the root directory of the SD card."
msgstr "将 FIRMWARE_660R_F.bin 的副本放在 SD 卡根目录下。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:93 b948b0857a5d482082b530e6a833e1ba
msgid ""
"Rebooting with Sonix board bootloader pin pulled down will cause the Sonix "
"board load firmware from SD card. Sonix board bootloader pad is marked as "
"TP4 next to Sonix chip. Need to remove metal shield to reach."
msgstr ""
"在 Sonix 板引导程序引脚拉低的状态下重启，将使 Sonix 板从 SD 卡加载固件。Sonix 板引导程序焊盘标记为 Sonix 芯片旁的 "
"TP4，需移除金属屏蔽才能触及。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:96 d1625466db0b47c381adb4a16c27dfde
msgid "Temporarily solder thin wire to SD card slot metal part (GND)."
msgstr "临时将细导线焊接到 SD 卡槽金属部分（接地端）。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:97 8c042f3709b441c8a6af31c9800b2291
msgid "Copy FIRMWARE_660R_F.bin to the root of SD card."
msgstr "将 FIRMWARE_660R_F.bin 复制到 SD 卡根目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:98 24229680e9e6483e8cf95e68b4359ce5
msgid "Connect battery while the other end of wire touching the pad."
msgstr "在导线另一端接触焊盘的同时接上电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:100 11ff28ea0bc54884ab5ff59ca8e0811a
msgid "If this boot process goes well, firmware file should be erased."
msgstr "如果此启动过程顺利完成，固件文件应被删除。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:104 8e3d7cd20d4b4ce8b6b3b671d5033f4f
msgid "Developing the Sonix Firmware"
msgstr "开发 Sonix 固件"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:115 15199825235641529c6b76f5a086f817
msgid "``FIRMWARE_660R.bin`` can be uploaded using the web interface"
msgstr "``FIRMWARE_660R.bin`` 可通过 Web 界面上传。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:117 7d4706d7eb53460d9d2044b639fea471
msgid "You can also push the firmware directly to the Sonix board:"
msgstr "您也可以将固件直接推送到 Sonix 板："

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:135 05c0acba29f0461db4cba60d79d25235
msgid "Developing the Transmitter Firmware"
msgstr "开发发射器固件"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:139 b43c906a891d46c591b3513dd5a8615a
msgid ""
"The transmitter is relatively easy to make unbootable! Recovery requires an "
"ST-Link hardware tool and the ``stm8flash`` tool.  If you do not have access"
" to those, you may wish to reconsider modifying your transmitter firmware!"
msgstr ""
"发射器相对容易变砖！恢复需要 ST-Link 硬件工具和 ``stm8flash`` 工具。如果您没有这些工具，请慎重考虑是否修改发射器固件！"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:152 93adfd38c52e48feb48ef07ffa617f40
msgid ""
"``txmain.img`` can be flashed using the web interface.  Once the image is "
"transferred, the transmitter will need to be power-cycled for the upgrade to"
" continue.  It will take about 15 seconds to flash the new firmware. The "
"LEDs will flash alternately at 1Hz during upgrade."
msgstr ""
"``txmain.img`` 可通过 Web 界面刷写。镜像传输完成后，需要对发射器重新上电才能继续升级。刷写新固件约需 15 秒，升级期间 LED "
"灯将以 1Hz 频率交替闪烁。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:156 6e6178a6498444b19e47205b72b1b069
msgid "MAVLink Access"
msgstr "MAVLink 访问"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:158 11c8700f79784b63bdd94bccea23c0c5
msgid ""
"When on WiFi the drone broadcasts MAVLink traffic on UDP port 14550. Start "
"up your favourite GCS and ask it to connect to port 14550 on UDP."
msgstr ""
"连接 WiFi 后，无人机在 UDP 端口 14550 上广播 MAVLink 数据流。启动您偏好的地面站软件，并让其通过 UDP 连接到 14550 "
"端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:160 4aafc114a559452aaeaf619cdd1779cb
msgid ""
"After connecting on WiFI you may wish to change the WiFi password or SSID on"
" ``http://192.168.99.1/system.html``. Note that to use the SkyViper app, the"
" SSID must start with ``SKYVIPERGPS_``"
msgstr ""
"通过 WiFi 连接后，您可能希望在 ``http://192.168.99.1/system.html`` 上更改 WiFi 密码或 "
"SSID。请注意，若要使用 SkyViper 应用，SSID 必须以 ``SKYVIPERGPS_`` 开头。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:165 c54e48793d994ce7af852ac36bda7ea5
msgid "Development Console"
msgstr "开发控制台"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:167 c8b50271b46348ff936430ab58472b29
