"netcat（https://eternallybored.org/misc/netcat/），然后按如下方式使用控制台："

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:180 e9f46c84d88a492eae23c3d10bf735ee
msgid "Transmitter Tricks"
msgstr "发射器技巧"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:183 7c0fb62e91374261a73e5c9d4e5bad9e
msgid "Force-bind a transmitter"
msgstr "强制绑定发射器"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:185 148d4fc692254eb88bf54b3c768a3301
msgid ""
"Go to the transmitter tab of the status web page, and press the “Bind "
"Transmitter” button. The drone will wait for a TX to startup in bind mode."
msgstr "进入状态网页的发射器选项卡，按下「绑定发射器」按钮。无人机将等待发射器以绑定模式启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:186 cb95b8fe27754abfb13669f13c87a6de
msgid ""
"To start the TX in bind mode, power it on with the left (HOME) button "
"pressed (for DSM2) or the right button pressed (for DSMX). Right now we are "
"recommending DSM2, but that may change."
msgstr "以绑定模式启动发射器时，按住左（HOME）键上电（DSM2）或按住右键上电（DSMX）。目前推荐使用 DSM2，但后续可能有所变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:190 8339524fc9b745e79aaec4c6c825c730
msgid "The TX uses beeps and LEDs to indicate status"
msgstr "发射器通过蜂鸣和 LED 指示状态"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:192 5d394907d7024313af7f3ad01c668ae2
msgid ""
"a 1Hz short beep when searching for a RX. The beeping stops when it connects"
" to the RX."
msgstr "搜索接收器时以 1Hz 短鸣；连接到接收器后停止蜂鸣。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:193 1fad68735f6b42558ba767791924ba69
msgid "a tune played on mode change"
msgstr "模式切换时播放提示音"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:194 a4f96054ddb5458aa153ceb9f49dc167
msgid ""
"an inactivity alarm on no drone telemetry and no stick movement after 170 "
"seconds. Power off at 180s."
msgstr "无人机遥测无信号且摇杆 170 秒无操作后触发无操作告警，180 秒后自动关机。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:195 68e1b1905b8a4ffcac03ee2bd5068fa2
msgid "battery alarm on battery failsafe"
msgstr "电池失效保护时触发电池告警"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:199 5ce1df67ffba4b10a1d11f9e74f4c22c
msgid "Use a different transmitter"
msgstr "使用其他发射器"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:201 e8f6eddf071d405d8c285d555a7ebd22
msgid ""
"You can bind another DSM2 (or possibly DSMX) compatible transmitter if you "
"have one. The OrangeRX DSM2/DSMX JR module from hobbyking works well in a "
"FrSky Taranis. To use a different transmitter you will probably have to "
"force the DSM protocol version. Settings are:"
msgstr ""
"如果您有其他 DSM2（或可能兼容 DSMX）发射器，可以进行绑定。来自好盈（hobbyking）的 OrangeRX DSM2/DSMX JR 模块与"
" FrSky Taranis 配合良好。使用不同发射器时，可能需要强制指定 DSM 协议版本。相关设置为："

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:211 05b0db3f337f4b558a180b8a62816fb6
msgid "Mode1/Mode2"
msgstr "模式1/模式2"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:213 5f48a851af0e42bf9abfb10f08e588a1
msgid ""
"The default TX stick mapping is mode2. To change to mode1, go to the Flight "
"Parameters page in the web interface "
"(``http://192.168.99.1/parameters.html``) and choose the Radio category. "
"Change ``BRD_RADIO_STKMD`` to your preferred RC mode. Modes 1, 2, 3 and 4 "
"are supported."
msgstr ""
"默认发射器摇杆映射为模式2。要切换到模式1，请进入 Web "
"界面的飞行参数页（``http://192.168.99.1/parameters.html``），选择无线电类别，将 "
"``BRD_RADIO_STKMD`` 更改为您偏好的 RC 模式。支持模式 1、2、3 和 4。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:216 1c262f777ace4b86979d2e6dbb881689
msgid "Disabling RX Telemetry"
msgstr "禁用接收器遥测"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:218 c4647678d7784a7faaf08ec9ff42af1d
msgid ""
"You can temporarily disable telemetry from the drone by setting the "
"``BRD_RADIO_TELEM`` parameters to zero. See the parameters page at "
"http://192.168.99.1/parameters.html"
msgstr ""
"您可以通过将 ``BRD_RADIO_TELEM`` 参数设置为零来临时禁用来自无人机的遥测。请参阅 "
"http://192.168.99.1/parameters.html 上的参数页。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:220 5fdd507e26c147de8b059a39aaf6ed26
msgid ""
"When telemetry is disabled the TX will beep constantly as it tries to find "
"the drone, and won’t update the buzzer or LEDs for fight mode changes."
msgstr "禁用遥测后，发射器将持续蜂鸣以尝试寻找无人机，且不会在飞行模式切换时更新蜂鸣器或 LED。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:224 1025026047f7455e956d4a705e4b2bd6
msgid "Factory Test Mode for TX/RX"
msgstr "发射器/接收器工厂测试模式"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:226 6247c5be9da24c2f99b01df9aa8809b4
msgid ""
"To facilitate rapid testing of transmitters in the factory there is a "
"special factory test mode. This mode avoids the need to bind each "
"transmitter, and gives fast startup on fixed channels. Factory test mode can"
" be setup for up to 8 test stations in the factory. Each test station should"
" have its own test copter. To setup a copter for factory test mode you need "
"to set a receiving copter as the test copter for a particular test station. "
"You do this by setting the ``BRD_RADIO_TESTCH`` parameter in the Radio "
"parameters on ``http://192.168.99.1/parameters.html`` to a factory testing "
"station number. This can be:"
msgstr ""
"为方便工厂快速测试发射器，特设一种工厂测试模式。该模式无需对每台发射器进行绑定，并可在固定信道上快速启动。工厂测试模式最多可为工厂内 8 "
"个测试站配置。每个测试站应有专属的测试飞行器。为将飞行器设置为工厂测试模式，需在 "
"``http://192.168.99.1/parameters.html`` 的无线电参数中将 ``BRD_RADIO_TESTCH`` "
"参数设置为对应的工厂测试站编号，可选值为："

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:243 2ecf3e4efce94fe6ba61650e52823225
msgid "You must reboot after setting this parameter."
msgstr "设置此参数后必须重启。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:245 c9b12720044c4c37be9a2c1969c1615c
msgid ""
"To test a transmitter you need to boot it into test mode for the right test "
"station. To do this you need to power on the transmitter with the left "
"shoulder button pressed, and with the left stick in one of 4 possible "
"positions:"
msgstr "要测试发射器，需让其以正确测试站的测试模式启动。为此，需在按住左肩键的同时上电，并将左摇杆置于以下 4 个位置之一："

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:258 531a89ab8bd04c019ce3fb4ad8e32f39
msgid ""
"When you startup in factory test mode the transmitter will play a different "
"buzzer tune, and will bind immediately with the receiver. You can then do "
"rapid testing on the Transmitter tab of the status page on the web interface"
" at ``http://192.168.99.1/status.html``. Each test station uses a different "
"set of channels, so are unlikely to interfere with each other."
msgstr ""
"以工厂测试模式启动时，发射器将播放不同的蜂鸣提示音，并立即与接收器绑定。随后可在 ``http://192.168.99.1/status.html``"
" Web 界面状态页的发射器选项卡上进行快速测试。每个测试站使用不同的信道组，因此相互之间不易产生干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:264 e2b5dbf648374db09e67f204586d401d
msgid "Log Files"
msgstr "日志文件"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:266 9626882e500248a385dee3488285cd77
msgid ""
"DataFlash logs are stored on the microSD card of the Sonix in the DATAFLASH "
"directory. You can access them via the filesystem interface of the web "
"interface. In order to enable logging while Disarmed, go to the web "
"interface Flight Parameters page, select Logging, in the drop-down, and set "
"LOG_DISARMED to 1:ENABLED."
msgstr ""
"DataFlash 日志存储在 Sonix 的 microSD 卡 DATAFLASH 目录下，可通过 Web "
"界面的文件系统接口访问。若要在解锁状态下启用日志记录，请进入 Web 界面飞行参数页，从下拉列表中选择「日志记录」，并将 LOG_DISARMED "
"设置为 1:ENABLED。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:268 b736222ec2ee4fe2a9a9a05653fb41fe
msgid ""
"Logs are binary files and can be viewed in several log viewers, including "
"MissionPlanner."
msgstr "日志为二进制文件，可使用多种日志查看器查看，包括 MissionPlanner。"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:271 de9bb710392d4e158580ab9f4dbf0a19
msgid "Factory Reset"
msgstr "恢复出厂设置"

#: ../../source/docs/skyviper.rst:273 ce049b82c62a46db82252fa29372004a
msgid ""
"If all else fails put a file called ``FACRESET.TXT`` in the root of the "
"microSD. It should do a factory reset on next boot."
msgstr "如果其他方法均失败，请在 microSD 根目录下放置一个名为 ``FACRESET.TXT`` 的文件，下次启动时将执行恢复出厂设置。"

